  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2.27 - Windows/.NET-Friendly Development Experience\n🎯 CSX Scripts: Migrated to C# scripts (.csx) for Windows/.NET-friendly development\n🖼️ Promotional Materials: Integrated featured image and branding\n💜 .NET Foundation: Added thank you section with C# evolution history\n🛠️ Script Improvements: Fixed test-all-locally.csx process handling\n📚 Documentation: Enhanced with 88 generated API docs and improved structure\n✅ Testing: 255 tests passing across all platforms\n🔧 Developer Experience: CSX scripts with Spectre.Console for rich terminal UI\n💎 Sponsored by IronSoftware\n\nDocumentation: https://jacob-mellor.github.io/curl-dot-net/\nRepository: https://github.com/jacob-mellor/curl-dot-net\nNuGet: https://www.nuget.org/packages/CurlDotNet/",
